{"page":457,"exact":true,"blocks":[{"x":0.72415,"y":0.05257,"w":0.22737,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"t":"7.3 双曲函数 443"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.093,"w":0.12748,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"t":"有用的恒等式"},{"x":0.10738,"y":0.10214,"w":0.18495,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"表7.8 反双曲函数的恒等式"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.11578,"w":0.59302,"h":0.04537,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"我们使用表7.8中的恒等式来计算在计算器上只有cosh-1x、sinh-1x和tanh-1x时sech-1x、csch-1x和coth-1x的值。这些恒等式是定义的直接结果。例如，如果0 < x ≤ 1，那么"},{"x":0.1082,"y":0.14332,"w":0.1271,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"sech-1x = cosh-1(1/x)"},{"x":0.47197,"y":0.16925,"w":0.10647,"h":0.02771,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"sech(acosh-1(a)) = a"},{"x":0.57074,"y":0.17372,"w":0.1216,"h":0.02747,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"x^b / b = 1"},{"x":0.75995,"y":0.17713,"w":0.03586,"h":0.01914,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"= 1"},{"x":0.1082,"y":0.18013,"w":0.12438,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"csch-1x = sinh-1(1/x)"},{"x":0.81383,"y":0.18348,"w":0.02832,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= x"},{"x":0.62398,"y":0.18758,"w":0.10742,"h":0.02771,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"cosh(acosh-1(a)) = a"},{"x":0.72369,"y":0.19206,"w":0.02716,"h":0.02747,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"x^b / b = a"},{"x":0.77866,"y":0.19206,"w":0.01714,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"a^1"},{"x":0.78809,"y":0.19206,"w":0.01664,"h":0.02747,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"x^b / b"},{"x":0.1082,"y":0.21695,"w":0.12427,"h":0.01982,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"coth-1x = tanh-1(1/x)"},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.23599,"w":0.59301,"h":0.03002,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"我们还知道sech(sech-1x) = x，因此由于双曲正割在(0, 1/4)上是单射的，我们有"},{"x":0.5809,"y":0.269,"w":0.06288,"h":0.02771,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"cosh(acosh-1(a)) = sech-1x"},{"x":0.63608,"y":0.27348,"w":0.09713,"h":0.02747,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"x^b / b = sech-1x."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.32065,"w":0.33115,"h":0.01375,"fs":0.01375,"n":1,"t":"反双曲函数的导数"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.3453,"w":0.59291,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"反双曲函数的一个重要用途在于求反导数，这些反导数可以逆转表7.9中的导数公式。"},{"x":0.47492,"y":0.41117,"w":0.36546,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"表7.9 反双曲函数的导数"},{"x":0.47581,"y":0.43874,"w":0.0686,"h":0.01467,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(sinh-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.57057,"y":0.44274,"w":0.08001,"h":0.03086,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"1 + u^2 du/dx"},{"x":0.50242,"y":0.44291,"w":0.10213,"h":0.0271,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"dx = 1"},{"x":0.47581,"y":0.48337,"w":0.07132,"h":0.01467,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(cosh-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.57329,"y":0.48737,"w":0.18269,"h":0.03086,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"2u^2 - 1 du/dx，u > 1"},{"x":0.50378,"y":0.48755,"w":0.10349,"h":0.0271,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"dx = 1"},{"x":0.47581,"y":0.52801,"w":0.06944,"h":0.01468,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(tanh-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.50284,"y":0.532,"w":0.26516,"h":0.0289,"fs":0.01279,"n":7,"t":"dx = 1 / (1 - u^2) du/dx，|u| < 1"},{"x":0.47581,"y":0.57264,"w":0.06944,"h":0.01468,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(coth-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.50284,"y":0.57664,"w":0.26516,"h":0.0289,"fs":0.01279,"n":7,"t":"dx = 1 / (1 - u^2) du/dx，|u| > 1"},{"x":0.47581,"y":0.61728,"w":0.07038,"h":0.01468,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(sech-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.65954,"y":0.62127,"w":0.1294,"h":0.02729,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"du/dx，0 < u < 1"},{"x":0.50331,"y":0.62145,"w":0.15199,"h":0.03068,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"dx = -1 / (u^2 - u)"},{"x":0.47582,"y":0.66191,"w":0.07037,"h":0.01468,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"d(csch-1u)/dx"},{"x":0.67587,"y":0.6659,"w":0.08093,"h":0.02729,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"du/dx，u ≠ 0"},{"x":0.50331,"y":0.66609,"w":0.16831,"h":0.03068,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"dx = -1 / (|u|^2 + u)"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.73404,"w":0.59304,"h":0.06071,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"tanh-1u和coth-1u的导数公式中的|u| < 1和|u| > 1的限制来自于这些函数值的自然限制。（参见图7.9a和b。）当我们将导数公式转换为积分公式时，|u| < 1和|u| > 1的区别变得很重要。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.79731,"w":0.59305,"h":0.04348,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"我们在例2中说明了如何找到反双曲函数的导数，其中我们计算d(cosh-1u)/dx。其他导数可以通过类似的计算得到。"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.86466,"w":0.59298,"h":0.02984,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"t":"例2 证明如果u是x的可微函数，且其值大于1，那么"},{"x":0.55975,"y":0.9052,"w":0.14287,"h":0.02729,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"d/dx(cosh-1u) = 1 / (2u^2 - 1) du/dx"},{"x":0.66863,"y":0.9052,"w":0.08579,"h":0.03086,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"dx = 1"}]}